<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1JN" style="id">- Ibaas</book>
  <para style="h">1 AYohana</para>
  <para style="toc3">1AYoh</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 AYohana</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kufumung imɛsɛng fɛ́ aYohana Jɛk</para>
  <para style="mt1">1 AYohana</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kufumung imɛsɛng <optbreak /> fɛ́ aYohana Jɛk</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1JN 1" />
  <para style="s">Ifɛ̀ fi i nesek kutset</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 1:1" />In tsin ki jɛk yin ne naton Ifɛ̀ fi i kin se ni imɛsɛng, fi iyit kin fok yit, fi in kin di yit na ayisi yit, fi in kin yɛrɛ yit, fi mbɔk yit kin bamang. In tsin ki jɛk yin e naton Ifɛ̀ fi i nesek kutset. <verse eid="1JN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 1:2" />Kutset e kin bɛ́, iyit di yit iko, in tsin di nesek yit kanu cɛɛt naton e, in tsin ki shara yin kutset vit igang e, fi ku kin se gung ne Ada, a mi bɛ́ ni yit. <verse eid="1JN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 1:3" />Iyit tsin ki taas yin, ikyɛng fi in kin di yit, fi in kin fok yit, nɔng iyin da bin moon yin ice ni iyit, na atsak e, imoon ice yit se gung ne Ada Adakunom, nɛ ari wu aYeso Kristi. <verse eid="1JN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 1:4" />In tsin jɛk yit nkyɔrɔk nang, nɔng iyɛ kan yit bin shining.<verse eid="1JN 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutseet ayɛt mgbey</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 1:5" />Iye itom e yeng, fi in kin fok yit ni wu, fi in tsin ki taas yin: Adakunom yet mgbey, vit itsarang ahwyi ayɛt wu. <verse eid="1JN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 1:6" />Ki iyit nye yit, fok in se yit ayɛt imoon ice ni wu, ni in tsin rēn ya yit kashon ni nggɔn ahwyi, in tsin wɔrɔk yit ace yit, in tsin nye yit kusot atsak awo. <verse eid="1JN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 1:7" />Awɛt ki ku tseng yit se ayɛt mgbey, kpaf ti iwu di se ni mgbey, ni in monoso yit ice ne bafidang yit, nasok ari wu aYeso, ki kan yit ayɛt anɛn yit ngma.<verse eid="1JN 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 1:8" />Ki iyit nye yit, fok da in bɛ́ yit inɛn awo, in tsin wɔrɔk yit ace yit, atsak di se ni yit awo. <verse eid="1JN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 1:9" />Ki in taas yit anɛn yit, Adakunom yet afɛ́ atsak, a se tabat, a da ki fuut yit anɛn yit, na ki kanang yit na kaakyi irèn anɛn. <verse eid="1JN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 1:10" />Ki iyit nye yit, fok in man ra yit inɛn awo, in kusas yit na a sot tɛ anet mbɔɔs, itonong fok ifɛ̀ wu se ayɛt yit awo.<verse eid="1JN 1:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1JN 2" />
  <para style="s">AYeso yet ayɔng fɛ́ a <optbreak /> nyeseng ashon Ada <optbreak /> akuce yit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 2:1" />Naban nnon in, in tsin ki jɛk yin nkyɔrɔk nang, kɔng i bi ra yin inɛn. Awɛt ke akak yin ra inɛn, in bɛ̀ yit ayɔng fɛ́ a nyeseng ashon adada akuce yit, a yet aYeso Kristi, afi kusot kutabat. <verse eid="1JN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 2:2" />Iwu fɛ́ a yet kunang itarang anɛn yit fɛ́ ba kin nabak, nek anɛn afiit kyɛk awo, a yet nek anɛn bafɛ́ azatse ngma kusum.<verse eid="1JN 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 2:3" />Na ane fi in rēn fok in ku rēn yit: ki in foos yit agbat ifɛ̀ wu. <verse eid="1JN 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 2:4" />Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a nye, &lt;&lt;Imi ku rēn,&gt;&gt; awɛt da na ne nye ngma ikyɛng fɛ́ agbat ifɛ̀ wu fɛ̀ awo, a yet anet mbɔɔs, atsak di se ni wu awo. <verse eid="1JN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 2:5" />Awɛt ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a foos agbat ifɛ̀ wu, na atsak e ishim Adakunom mi shining ni wu yɔng. Na ane wu fi in di rēn yit fok, in se yit ayɛt wu: <verse eid="1JN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 2:6" />Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a fɛ̀, iwu se ni kusot ayɛt wu, i se gbing-gbing na nye kuri nggɔn fɛ́ aYeso nye.<verse eid="1JN 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 2:7" />Bafidang in, in tsin ki jɛk yin agbat ifɛ̀ ifas awo, tit nzen e me, nyɔng fi i kin fok yin ni imɛsɛng e. Agbat ifɛ̀ nzen e nang yet ifɛ̀ fi i kin man fok yin. <verse eid="1JN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 2:8" />Ngma na anɔng, in tsin ki jɛk yin agbat ifɛ̀ nfas; nyɔng fi in yet atsak ni wu, ni ni yin, nek ahwyi tsin gosok, mgbey atsak mi kpa ron.<verse eid="1JN 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 2:9" />Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a nye fok iwu se ni mgbey, na ne na rawu arunyining, a resek mo ayɛt nhwyi. <verse eid="1JN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 2:10" />Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a shim arunyining, a se ayɛt mgbey, vit ikyɛng fi i se ni wu fi i da ku bɛ́ ni ikpa. <verse eid="1JN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 2:11" />Awɛt ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a rawu arunyining, a resek mo ayɛt nhwyi, a teng a goroso ayɛt nhwyi, a rēn karɔ fɛ́ a di tseng awo, nek ahwyi me mi ku fam ayisi.<verse eid="1JN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 2:12" />Naban nnon in, in tsin ki jɛk yin ne nek Adakunom mi ki fuut yin anɛn yin, nek iyerek aYeso.<verse eid="1JN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 2:13" />Badada, in tsin ki jɛk yin ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1JN 2:13">nek iyin ku rēn yin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1JN 2:13">iwu ayɔng fɛ́ a se neme ni imɛsɛng e.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1JN 2:13">Bacam, in tsin ki jɛk yin ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1JN 2:13">nek iyin mi ya yin agap amaan e me.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1JN 2:13">Naban nnon in, in tsin ki jɛk yin ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1JN 2:13">nek iyin rēn yin aDa me.<verse eid="1JN 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 2:14" />Badada, in tsin ki jɛk yin ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1JN 2:14">nek iyin ku rēn yin,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1JN 2:14">iwu yɔng fɛ́ a se</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1JN 2:14">neme ni imɛsɛng e.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1JN 2:14">Bacam, in tsin ki jɛk yin ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1JN 2:14">nek iyin bɛ̀ yin agap,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1JN 2:14">ifɛ̀ Adakunom se ayɛt yin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1JN 2:14">iyin mi ya yin agap amaan e me.<verse eid="1JN 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">I bi shim yin kazatse awo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 2:15" />I bi shim yin kazatse ki ikyɛng fi i se ayɛt azatse me awo. Ke akak shim kazatse, ishim aDa se ayɛt wu awo. <verse eid="1JN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 2:16" />Nek kaakyɛ fi i se azatse, nkyɔrɔk ti: ikyɛng fɛ́ anet inɛn tsɛsɛk, aduk ikɔk i sɛs ikyɛng fɛ́ ayisi yɛrɛ, ni itsot kugwɔm naton ikyɛng fi iwu bɛ̀ ni idɔng fɛ́ a nye, ngma nkyɔrɔk yɔng nes na aDa awo tit azatse. <verse eid="1JN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 2:17" />Kazatse nɛ aduk ikɔk ka tsin gosok, awɛt anet fɛ́ a nyes ishim Adakunom, bi nkum awo.<verse eid="1JN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nye yin yɛɛt naton banet <optbreak /> ifa na Anet-Isheshek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 2:18" />Naban nnon in, nnom nang yet nfi igang e. Kyɔn ti fi i kin fok yin fok anet ifa aKristi bi bɛ́, yɔkɔnɔng ana, bafi ifa aKristi me dot mi bɛ́. Na anɔng fi in di rēn yit fok nnom igang e nang. <verse eid="1JN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 2:19" />Ba kin wuruk ayɛt yit, awɛt ba kin yet bafiit na tsak e awo. Nek ke ba kin fɛ́ ba yet bafiit, ke ba kin sot gung ni iyit, awɛt kuwuruk bá tonong fok vit azining ba fɛ̀ a yet afiit.<verse eid="1JN 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 2:20" />Awɛt iyin ba mi ki korok yin name aJɛrɛ fɛ́ na ne na afɛ́ aJɛrɛ me, ngma yin i rēn yin atsak e. <verse eid="1JN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 2:21" />Da imi tsin ki jɛk yin ne fok nek i se yin vit irēn atsak e awo, tit nek i rēn yin atsak e, nɛ nek ba tɛ ba sɛs mbɔɔs na atsak e awo. <verse eid="1JN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1JN 2:22" />Angan wu fɛ́ a yet anet mbɔɔs ɛ? Anet mbɔɔs yet ayɔng fɛ́ a ra nanan fok aYeso yet Anet-Isheshek awo. Kuri ayɔng e yet anet ifa aKristi, a ra nanan aDa me nɛ Ari me. <verse eid="1JN 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1JN 2:23" />Vit ayɔng fɛ́ a ra nanan Ari me, fɛ́ a bɛ̀ Ada me; ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a shan Ari me, a bɛ̀ Ada me bà.<verse eid="1JN 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1JN 2:24" />Won itees fi i kin fok yin ni imɛsɛng e, di nak ni yin. Ki i nye yin anɔng, iyin di ki nak yin na Ari me nɛ na aDa me bà. <verse eid="1JN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1JN 2:25" />Na anɔng, ikyɛng fɛ́ a ki nye yit kushii me yet kutset vit igang.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni ilem aGirik, ikorok name aJɛrɛ se nagbɔng fɛ́ ba di yes Anet-Isheshek. AYohana fɛ́ bayɔng ba mi kaba korok name ajɛrɛ ba yet bayɔng fɛ́ ba mi kana moon na Anet-Isheshek. Nek anɔng ba rēn atsak e. Bayɔng fɛ́ ba bi ifà na Anet-Isheshek, ba rēn atsak e awo.</char></note><verse eid="1JN 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1JN 2:26" />Imi tsin ki jɛk yin nkyɔrɔk nang naton bayɔng fɛ́ ba tsɛt ba ki tsa yin natse. <verse eid="1JN 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1JN 2:27" />Wat iyin, ikorok name aJɛrɛ fi i mi sɛ yin ni wu, di nak ni yin. I ti tsɛt yin akak ki tees yin awo. Awɛt fi ikorok name aJɛrɛ wu tsin ki tees yin kaakyɛ, ni ikorok name me yet atsak, vit mbɔɔs ni ye. Nek anɔng, kyɔn tɛ fɛ́ a ki tees yin, sot yin ni wu.<verse eid="1JN 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nnon Adakunom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1JN 2:28" />Yɔkɔnɔng ana, naban nnon, di nak yin ni wu, nɔng izen fɛ́ a bi bɛ́, in bi bɛ̀ yit agap iyɛ, vit nsum ashon wu ni izen kubɛ́ wu.<verse eid="1JN 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1JN 2:29" />Ki i rēn yin fok, a se tabat nanu ashon Adakunom, i rēn yin tsɛngtsɛng fok ngma ayɔng fɛ́ ba se tabat nanu ashon wu, ba yet kutes wu.<verse eid="1JN 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1JN 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 3:1" />Di yin kudot ishim fɛ́ aDa ki nye yit ne, fi i sak ba ki yes yit nnon Adakunom! Anɔng e fi in yet yit. Ikyɛng fi i sak banet azatse ki rēn yit awo yet nek iba ku rēn awo. <verse eid="1JN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 3:2" />Bafidang in, yɔkɔnɔng in yet yit nnon Adakunom, ikyɛng fi in bi sot yit sak ashon, ba mi rēn ide ninyɛn awo. Awɛt ikyɛng fi in rēn yit yet fok, ni izen fɛ́ ba bi rēn ide, in bi sot yit ti iwu, nek in bi ku di yit tɛ fɛ́ a di se. <verse eid="1JN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 3:3" />Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a bɛ̀ kuri ite iyɛ yeng ni wu, a sosok cɛ́l, kyɔn ti iwu di se cɛ́l.<verse eid="1JN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 3:4" />Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a ras inɛn, a tsin ibeseng ntsi Adakunom yɔng. Nek inɛn de i yet ibeseng ntsi. <verse eid="1JN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 3:5" />Awɛt iyin irēn yin fok ba bɛ́ na aYeso, nɔng a da bin sok anɛn, nek iwu bi inɛn awo. <verse eid="1JN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 3:6" />Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a se ayɛt wu, da a ya kashon ni iras inɛn awo. Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a ya kashon ni ras inɛn, a mang di aYeso awo, kɛ a ku rēn awo.<verse eid="1JN 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 3:7" />Naban nnon in, i bi won in akak ki tsas yin natse awo. Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a ras ikyɛng fi i se gyat, a yet afi kusot kutabat ashon Adakunom, kyɔn tɛ fi Iwu di se tabat ashon Adakunom. <verse eid="1JN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 3:8" />Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a ras ikyɛng fi i yet ifi inɛn, a yet afɛ́ aShetan, nek aShetan yet afi iras inɛn neme ni imɛsɛng e. Nek anɔng wu tun aRim Adakunom mok a di beseng kutomong aShetan ngma kusum. <verse eid="1JN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 3:9" />Vit ayɔng fɛ́ a yet kutes Adakunom, fɛ́ a tɛ a ya kashon ni iras inɛn, nek kutset Adakunom se ni wu, a da kyem a tɛ a ya kashon ni iras inɛn awo, nek a mi sot kutes Adakunom. <verse eid="1JN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 3:10" />Na ane wu fi in di rēn bayɔng fɛ́ ba yet nnon Adakunom, nɛ bayɔng fɛ́ ba yet nnon aShetan: ngma ayɔng fɛ́ da a ras ikyɛng fi i se gyat awo, nɛ ayɔng fɛ́ da a shim arunyining awo, a yet nggon Adakunom awo.<verse eid="1JN 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shim yin bafidang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 3:11" />Itees e yeng ye fi in kin fok yit ni imɛsɛng e: i se gbing-gbing ni in shim yit bafidang yit. <verse eid="1JN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 3:12" />Da i bi nye yin tɛ aKayinu awo, iwu fɛ́ a sot afɛ́ aShetan, a fɛt arunyining. Akyɛ fi i kin sak a ku fɛt mo yɛ? Nek ntomong wu kin yet nfɛ́ anyas, ni ntomong arunyining kin yet nfi kusot kutabat ashon Adakunom. <verse eid="1JN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 3:13" />Ábaruneng, a bi ki te yin yɔɔt ke kazatse ki rayin awo. <verse eid="1JN 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 3:14" />Iyit rēn yit fok in mi shorop yit iku sak i sɛ kutset nek in shim yit baruneng yit. Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a tonoso ishim awo, a resek mo nawop iku. <verse eid="1JN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 3:15" />Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a rawu arunyining, a yet anet ikok kutset. Iyin rēn yin fok, ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a kok kutset fɛ́ a bɛ̀ kutset vit igang ayɛt wu.<verse eid="1JN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 3:16" />Ne ane fi in di rēn yit ikyɛng fi ishim yet: aYeso Kristi mees kutset wu nek iyit. Nek anɔng, i se yɛɛt ni in mees yit kutset yit nek baruneng yit. <verse eid="1JN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 3:17" />Ke akak bi ikyɛng azatse, na yɛrɛ arunyining ayɛt kudaam, na rawu dang fok angmishish wu, i se wɛshɛk fok ishim Adakunom se ni iwu awo. <verse eid="1JN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 3:18" />Naban nnon in, won da ishim yit bi se ni ncɛɛt anu nɛ ni ilem kyɛk awo, tit ishim fɛ́ ba tonoso ni ntomong nɛ atsak. <verse eid="1JN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 3:19" />Na anɔng wu fi in di rēn yit fok in se yit ayɛt atsak, ni in bɛ̀ yit imen iyɛ ashon Adakunom, <verse eid="1JN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 3:20" />ni izen fɛ́ ayɛ yit tsin ki ya yit ni ishɔt e. Nek Adakunom wat kuyiring ayɛ yit, iwu rēn kaakyɛ.<verse eid="1JN 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 3:21" />Bafidang in, ke da ayɛ yit tsin ki ya yit ni ishɔt awo, in bɛ̀ yit iyɛ ting ashon Adakunom, <verse eid="1JN 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1JN 3:22" />in da sɛ yit ngma ikyɛng fi in ku rip yit, nek in foos yit agbat ifɛ̀ wu, ni iras yit ikyɛng fi iwu shim. <verse eid="1JN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1JN 3:23" />Agbat Ifɛ̀ wu me yeng: ni in shan yit atsak ni iyerek Ari wu, aYeso Kristi, ni in tonoso yit ishim sak na bafidang yit kyɔn tɛ agbat ifɛ̀ wu di fɛ̀ ni iyit. <verse eid="1JN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1JN 3:24" />Ngma bayɔng fɛ́ ba foos agbat ifɛ̀ wu, ba se ayɛt wu, iwu se ayɛt ba. Na ane fi in di rēn yit fok a se ayɛt yit: in rēn yit anɔng nek Kabik wu fɛ́ a ki nɔɔk.<verse eid="1JN 3:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1JN 4" />
  <para style="s">Mara yin kaakye kabik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 4:1" />Bafidang in, i bi nesek yin atsak na kaakyɛ kabik awo, awɛt mara yin nabik e ninyɛn da di ke ka ne na Adakunom ɛ, nek batan mbɔɔs dot mi nɔ azatse. <verse eid="1JN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 4:2" />Na ane fi i da rēn yin Kabik Adakunom: kaakyɛ kabik fɛ́ ka fɛ̀ ey fok aYeso Kristi mi bɛ́ ayɛt irɔm, ka ne na Adakunom, <verse eid="1JN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 4:3" />awɛt kaakyɛ kabik fɛ́ da ka shan atsak naton aYeso awo, ka ne na Adakunom awo. Kabik e yɔng ka ka yet ka fɛ́ anet ifa aKristi, fi i kin fok yin fok ka bi bɛ́, yɔkɔnɔng ana ka mi nɔ azatse.<verse eid="1JN 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 4:4" />Iyin naban nnon, iyin ne yin na Adakunom, i mi ya yin awɛng naton ba, nek ayɔng fɛ́ a se ayɛt yin, a wat ayɔng fɛ́ a se azatse. <verse eid="1JN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 4:5" />Iba yet bafɛ́ azatse, nek anɔng, ba cɛɛt kuri kucɛɛt banet azatse, ne kazatse ka ba foos. <verse eid="1JN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 4:6" />Iyit ne yit na Adakunom, ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a rēn Adakunom, ki foos yit; awɛt ngma ayɔng fɛ́ da a yet afɛ́ Adakunom awo, wes ato ni iyit awo. Na ane fi in di rēn yit Kabik atsak ne kabik mbɔɔs.<verse eid="1JN 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ishim Adakunom ni ifiit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 4:7" />Bafidang in, won ni in shim bafidang yit, nek ishim nes na Adakunom. Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a tonoso ishim, a yet kutes Adakunom, a rēn Adakunom. <verse eid="1JN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 4:8" />Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ da a tonoso ishim awo, a rēn Adakunom awo, nek Adakunom yet ishim. <verse eid="1JN 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 4:9" />Na ane fɛ́ Adakunom ki tonong yit ishim wu: a tom azizɛɛt Ari wu kyɛk sak azatse, nɔng in da sɛ yit kutset ni wu. <verse eid="1JN 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 4:10" />Ishim e se ane: da iyit ba fi in kin shim yit Adakunom awo, tit Adakunom iwu fɛ́ a ki shim yit, a tom na Ari wu ti kunang itarang anɛn yit. <verse eid="1JN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 4:11" />Bafidang in, nek ishim fɛ́ Adakunom ki tonong yit, i se gyat iyit ni in tonong yit bafidang yit ishim bà. <verse eid="1JN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 4:12" />Vit anet fɛ́ a kin man di Adakunom; awɛt ki in tonoso yit bafidang yit ishim, Adakunom se ayɛt yit, ishim wu mi shining ayɛt yit.<verse eid="1JN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 4:13" />Iyit rēn yit fok in se yit ayɛt wu, iwu se ayɛt yit, nek iwu mi ki nɔɔk yit Kabik wu. <verse eid="1JN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 4:14" />Iyit ice yit, in mi di yit, in mi ti tas yit ne nanu yit fok, aDa mi tom Ari wu, na a sot Anet-Isheshek kazatse. <verse eid="1JN 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 4:15" />Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a fɛ̀ ey fok aYeso yet Arim Adakunom, Adakunom se ayɛt wu, iwu se ayɛt Adakunom. <verse eid="1JN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 4:16" />Nek anɔng fi in di rēn yit, in di te yit yɛndɛng ni ishim fɛ́ Adakunom bɛ̀ nek iyit.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1JN 4:16">Adakunom yet ishim. Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a se ayɛt ishim e, a se ayɛt Adakunom, Adakunom se ayɛt wu. <verse eid="1JN 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 4:17" />Na anɔng wu, fi ishim di shining ayɛt yit, nɔng in da bin sot yit ni iyɛ ting atuk ishɔt igang azatse, nek azeng azatse, in se yit ti iwu. <verse eid="1JN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 4:18" />Ishim bi nnyim awo. Ishim atsak ro nnyim, nek nnyim bɛ́s nek kuyiring itabak. Anet fɛ́ a bi nnyim, ishim wu mi shining yɛɛt-yɛɛt awo.<verse eid="1JN 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 4:19" />Iyit tonoso yit ishim, nek iwu tun ki tonong yit ishim. <verse eid="1JN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 4:20" />Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Imi shim Adakunom,&gt;&gt; awɛt na rawu arunyining, a yet anet mbɔɔs. Nek ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a rawu dang shim arunyining, ayɔng fi iwu tsin yɛrɛ, a da kyem a shim Adakunom fi iwu kin man di awo. <verse eid="1JN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 4:21" />Ni igang e, iwu mi ki nɔɔk yit agbat ifɛ̀ deng: ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a shim Adakunom, i se gbing-gbing na a shim arunyining bà.<verse eid="1JN 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1JN 5" />
  <para style="s">Atsak ayɛt Arim Adakunom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 5:1" />Kaangan fɛ́ a nɔɔk atsak fok aYeso wu a yet Anet-Isheshek, a mi sot kutes Adakunom, ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a shim ada me, a shim nggon wu bà. <verse eid="1JN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 5:2" />Na ane fi in di rēn yit fok in shim yit nnon Adakunom, kin shim yit Adakunom, ni in nyes yit ikyɛng fɛ́ agbat ifɛ̀ wu fɛ̀ ni yit. <verse eid="1JN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 5:3" />Na ane fi in di tonong yit ishim yit sak na Adakunom: inyes yit ikyɛng fɛ́ agbat ifɛ̀ wu fɛ̀ ni yit. Agbat ifɛ̀ wu se diring awo, <verse eid="1JN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 5:4" />nek ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a mi sot kutes Adakunom, a sɛs awɛng naton kazatse. Iya awɛng naton kazatse se ne: inɔɔk atsak yit. <verse eid="1JN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 5:5" />Angan wu fɛ́ a ya awɛng na kazatse yɛ? Tit ayɔng fɛ́ a nɔɔk atsak fok aYeso yet Arim Adakunom.<verse eid="1JN 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 5:6" />AYeso Kristi wu fɛ́ a bɛ́ azatse, ni irèn ashi nɛ nasok.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">ni irèn ashi nɛ nasok</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Abaptisma wu ayɛt ashi ni inosong nasok wu ni kum. Ifɛ́ afaa me yet nse irɔm wu nek anɔng wu fɛ́ ashi nɛ nasok kin wuru ni irɔm wu fɛ́ ba kin ku tekak. Nek anɔng wu fɛ́ aYohana di buruk itees bafi itees mbɔɔs fɛ́ ba teng ba tees fok aYeso kin bɛ́ ni irɔm awo.</char></note> Da a kin bɛ́ ni irèn ashi kyɛk awo, tit ni irèn ashi nɛ nasok. Ayet Kabik wu ka nesek kanu icɛɛt, nek Kabik e yet atsak. <verse eid="1JN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 5:7" />Nek bataat ba fɛ̀ ba nesek kanu icɛɛt: <verse eid="1JN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 5:8" />Kabik, ashi, nɛ nasok, bataat e bɛ́ kanu kazining. <verse eid="1JN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 5:9" />In shashan yit kanu icɛɛt banet, awɛt kanu icɛɛt Adakunom se kashon, nek Adakunom wu a cɛɛt, a mi nɔɔk kanu icɛɛt naton Ari wu. <verse eid="1JN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 5:10" />Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a nɔɔk atsak ne Arim Adakunom, a rēn tsɛngtsɛng fok aYeso yet angan ɛ. Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a rawu inɔɔk atsak na Adakunom, a mi te Adakunom sot tɛ afi mbɔɔs, nek a rawu dang nɔɔk atsak ni kanu icɛɛt fɛ́ Adakunom fɛ̀ naton Ari wu. <verse eid="1JN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 5:11" />Kanu icɛɛt ka fɛ́ a kin nye: Adakunom mi ki nɔɔk yit kutset vit igang, kutset e se ayɛt Ari wu. <verse eid="1JN 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 5:12" />Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a bɛ̀ Ari me, a bɛ̀ kutset; ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a se vit Arim Adakunom, vit iwu ni kutset.<verse eid="1JN 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kucɛɛt igang e</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 5:13" />Imi tsin ki jɛk yin nkyɔrɔk nang, iyin bayɔng fi i mi nɔɔk yin atsak ni iyerek Arim Adakunom, nɔng i da rēn yin fok i bɛ̀ yin kutset vit igang. <verse eid="1JN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 5:14" />Iyɛ ting de fi in bɛ́ sak na Adakunom: ngma ikyɛng fi ki in rip yit kpaf ni ishim wu, a ki foos yit. <verse eid="1JN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 5:15" />Ki in rēn yit fok a ki foos, ngma ikyɛng fi in ku rip yit, in rēn yit fok in da sɛ yit.<verse eid="1JN 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 5:16" />Ke akak di arunyining na tsin ra inɛn fi da itsa sak ni iku awo, won na a ra awon, Adakunom da ku nɔɔk kutset. In cɛɛt naton bayɔng fi inɛn ba tsa sak ni iku awo. Inɛn di se fi i tsas sak ni iku, in tsin fɛ̀ na a ra awon naton idɔng awo. <verse eid="1JN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 5:17" />Ngma nkyɔrɔk nmaane in yet inɛn, awɛt inɛn di se fi da itsa sak ni iku awo.<verse eid="1JN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 5:18" />In rēn yit fok ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a mi sot kutes Adakunom,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni ilem aGirik: </char><char style="fk" closed="false">kutes Adakunom </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kucɛɛt se naton Arim Adakunom.</char></note> a ya kashon ni iras inɛn awo, nek Arim Adakunom ku berese, aShetan da kyem a ku man awo. <verse eid="1JN 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 5:19" />In rēn yit fok, in yet yit nnon Adakunom, fok kazatse kang ngma kusum ka se nawop aShetan. <verse eid="1JN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 5:20" />In ti in rēn yit fok Arim Adakunom mi bɛ́, a mi ki nɔɔk yit irēn, fi in di ki rēn yit Ayɔng fɛ́ a yet atsak. Iyit se yit ayɛt Ayɔng fɛ́ a yet atsak, in se yit ayɛt Ari wu aYeso Kristi. Iwu fɛ́ a yet Adakunom atsak e, a yet kutset vit igang e.<verse eid="1JN 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 5:21" />Naban nnon in, sak yin ace yin yik-yik na nabannom.<verse eid="1JN 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 5" />
</usx>